t\n\nModify User - lets you char into a person without VIP\n\n4TH TAB:\n\nOrbit Player - makes you orbit around a person\n\nWalk speed\nJump power\n\nTP Walk\nTP Walk speed\n\nFly\nFly speed\n\nNoclip\n\nFlashback - makes your character rewind\n\nFace Fuck - makes you character start fucking somone in the face\n\nTrip\nSpaz trip\n\n5TH TAB:\n\nCCTV:\nCamera lounge\nCamera private rooms\nCamera bathrooms\nCamera donut shop\n\n6TH TAB:\n\nFront flip\nBack flip\nLeft flip\nWHAT THE FUCK FLIP FUCK AHHHHHH\n\n7TH TAB:\n\nUnclaim all stalls\n*Makes you unclaim everyones stall*\n\n8TH TAB:\n\nSync tool\n\n9TH TAB:\n\nForce Join Voice\nForce Leave Voice\n\nIf your voice chat gets banned, you can use this to bypass it.\n\nBecome priority speaker - prioritizes your microphone input over other players.\n\n10TH TAB:\n\nR15 Animations - Opens a menu where you can use custom animations.\nAll emotes - Automatically gives you all the custom emotes.\nFlash step - Opens a small gui where you can turn on/off flash step\n\nInfinite yield\n\n11TH TAB/Setting tab:\n\nRejoin Game\nBecome Recommended Character\nBecom LocalPlayer\nPrivate Rooms Floor\nDisable Seats\nAnti-Annoy Void\n\nCustom Extend Baseplate\nExtend Baseplate\nPortable Platform\n\nDisable/Enable Christmas Music\n\nShow users\n-----------------------------------------\n\nThat's all the features in the menu! Keep in mind, the menu updates very often.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62b988880be5f7371b1c0130","username":"lovetoheil","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f14ef919f08d9a0dd004bdd6e8a832393374de25f0ea8a0cf45d47ddd5e0b077.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/62b988880be5f7371b1c0130-1734104916562.png"},"status":"offline","id":"62b988880be5f7371b1c0130","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f14ef919f08d9a0dd004bdd6e8a832393374de25f0ea8a0cf45d47ddd5e0b077.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com